            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Tony",
            "review_text": "Jenny P\nHue, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nDelicious sushi, warming environment & friendly staff\nApr 2017 • Friends\nThe first time I can eat fresh fish here -Sushi Tony - the food without cook.hahaha. Even if I tried to go to some Japanese restaurant then...deny to try them. But every pieces of fish here is really good. It makes me have to try because the fresh food, the great decoration and especially about the lovely staff- very very cute and kind with customers. \n\nDon't forget to try some Eel & Avocado Maki, Japanese Pancake, Salmon Tempura Maki, Salmon Skin Salad & sweet street drink in Vietnam: Orange Tea Peaches. So Yummy! Yummy! Yummy!\n\nI'll be back soon!\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2017\nHà L\nWe are moving to 219 nguyen cong tru Dist 1 - Hope to see you there\nWritten March 10, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
